<title>JAPAN: Forex stability important for stable growth - MOF.</title>
<headline>Forex stability important for stable growth - MOF.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japanese Finance Minister Hiroshi Mitsuzuka told the finance committee of parliament's Lower House on Wednesday that stability in foreign exchange rates is necessary for Japan to achieve sustainable economic growth without inflation.</p>
<p>Repeating remarks made earlier this week, Mitsuzuka said: &quot;Currency stability is important for stable growth without inflation.&quot;</p>
</text>
